<section class="section reveal" id="cognitive-services">
  <span class="section-label">Core Services</span>
  <h2>Cognitive Services: Pre-Built <span class="accent">Intelligence</span></h2>

  <p>Cognitive Services are Azure's library of pre-trained, ready-to-deploy AI models for common tasks. They eliminate the need to build, train, and maintain models for standard problems like document processing, text analysis, and image recognition. Each service is accessed via simple REST APIs or SDKs.</p>

  <p>The strength of Cognitive Services lies in their completeness: they handle edge cases and provide high accuracy out-of-the-box. The trade-off is limited customization — you cannot retrain the models on your own data (though some services offer fine-tuning options).</p>

  <h3>Vision APIs</h3>
  <p>Azure Computer Vision handles image understanding tasks. You call the API with an image URL or binary data, and it returns detected objects, text (OCR), faces, and scene descriptions:</p>

  <div class="code-header"><span class="code-lang">Python</span><button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
  <pre><code><span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">requests</span>
<span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">azure.cognitiveservices.vision.computervision</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="bi">ComputerVisionClient</span>

<span class="cm"># Initialize Azure Cognitive Services client</span>
<span class="va">client</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="bi">ComputerVisionClient</span>(
    <span class="st">"https://{region}.api.cognitive.microsoft.com/"</span>,
    <span class="bi">CognitiveServicesCredentials</span>(<span class="va">api_key</span>)
)

<span class="cm"># Analyze image for objects, text, faces</span>
<span class="va">result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="va">client</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">analyze_image_in_url</span>(
    <span class="st">"https://example.com/image.jpg"</span>,
    <span class="va">visual_features</span><span class="op">=</span>[<span class="st">"Objects"</span>, <span class="st">"Text"</span>, <span class="st">"Faces"</span>]
)

<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"Objects: </span>{<span class="va">result</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="va">objects</span>}<span class="st">"</span>)</code></pre>
  <div class="code-explain">
    <p><strong>What is happening here:</strong> We use Computer Vision API to analyze an image URL. The API returns detected objects, text via OCR, and faces with confidence scores. This is deployment-ready code with no model training required.</p>
  </div>

  <h3>Language Services</h3>
  <p>Azure Text Analytics processes and understands text at scale. Tasks include sentiment analysis, entity recognition, and key phrase extraction:</p>

  <div class="code-header"><span class="code-lang">Python</span><button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
  <pre><code><span class="im">from</span> <span class="nm">azure.ai.textanalytics</span> <span class="im">import</span> <span class="bi">TextAnalyticsClient</span>

<span class="va">client</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="bi">TextAnalyticsClient</span>(<span class="va">endpoint</span>, <span class="bi">AzureKeyCredential</span>(<span class="va">api_key</span>))

<span class="cm"># Analyze sentiment of customer feedback</span>
<span class="va">documents</span> <span class="op">=</span> [<span class="st">"Great product, highly recommend!"</span>]
<span class="va">result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="va">client</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">analyze_sentiment</span>(<span class="va">documents</span>)

<span class="kw">for</span> <span class="va">doc</span> <span class="kw">in</span> <span class="va">result</span>:
    <span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"Sentiment: </span>{<span class="va">doc</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="va">sentiment</span>}<span class="st">"</span>)</code></pre>
  <div class="code-explain">
    <p><strong>What is happening here:</strong> The Text Analytics API returns sentiment labels (positive, negative, neutral, mixed) with confidence scores. The API handles multilingual input without any training.</p>
  </div>

  <h3>Speech Services</h3>
  <p>Azure Speech Services provides speech-to-text, text-to-speech, and real-time translation, useful for conversational AI and accessibility features:</p>

  <div class="code-header"><span class="code-lang">Python</span><button class="copy-btn">Copy</button></div>
  <pre><code><span class="im">import</span> <span class="nm">azure.cognitiveservices.speech</span> <span class="kw">as</span> <span class="nm">speechsdk</span>

<span class="cm"># Initialize speech recognizer</span>
<span class="va">speech_config</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="nm">speechsdk</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="bi">SpeechConfig</span>(
    <span class="va">subscription</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="va">api_key</span>,
    <span class="va">region</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="st">"eastus"</span>
)
<span class="va">recognizer</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="nm">speechsdk</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="bi">SpeechRecognizer</span>(<span class="va">speech_config</span><span class="op">=</span><span class="va">speech_config</span>)

<span class="cm"># Recognize speech from microphone</span>
<span class="va">result</span> <span class="op">=</span> <span class="va">recognizer</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="fn">recognize_once</span>()
<span class="fn">print</span>(<span class="st">f"Recognized: </span>{<span class="va">result</span><span class="op">.</span><span class="va">text</span>}<span class="st">"</span>)</code></pre>
  <div class="code-explain">
    <p><strong>What is happening here:</strong> The Speech API listens to microphone input and returns recognized text. This single function call handles all complexity of speech processing — acoustic modeling, language modeling, and decoding.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="key-takeaway">
    <h4>✦ Key Takeaways</h4>
    <ul>
      <li>Cognitive Services provide instant AI capabilities via REST APIs with no training</li>
      <li>Services include Vision, Language, Speech, and Search APIs</li>
      <li>Each service is independently deployable and billed separately</li>
      <li>Combine multiple services to build rich, multi-modal AI applications</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>

