  <h2>Selecting Your <span class="accent">Azure AI Service</span></h2>

  <p>Choosing between Azure's services requires understanding your problem's characteristics, timeline, and constraints. Different services excel at different things. A document classification task might use pre-built Text Analytics for 80% accuracy in hours, or custom Azure ML for 95% accuracy in weeks.</p>

  <h3>Decision Matrix</h3>
  <div class="pipeline">
    <div class="pipeline-step">
      <div class="step-icon">?</div>
      <div class="step-label">Is this a standard AI problem?</div>
